# SoC (device) level Kconfig for the N32H7xx family.

config SOC_SERIES_N32H7
    bool "N32H7xx series"
    help
      N32H7xx Cortex-M7/M4 dual-core series. This port targets the CM7
      single-core configuration.

config SOC_N32H7XX
    bool "N32H76x (Cortex-M7)"
    select SOC_SERIES_N32H7
    select ARCH_CORTEX_M7
    select SOC_COMPANY_NSING
    help
      N32H76x device (CM7). Selecting this board pulls in the Cortex-M7
      arch, the NSING SoC company, and the N32H7xx SoC series.
